@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@recordId = 1

### 登录普通用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "ocean_user_001",
  "password": "Ocean1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("userAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 上传图片识别（演示识别器根据文件名识别：clown、blue-tang、unknown）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/detections?modelName=demo-yolo-v1&confidenceThreshold=0.5
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SeaFishBoundary

--SeaFishBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="clown-fish.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/clown-fish.jpg
--SeaFishBoundary--

### 查询自己的识别记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detections/me?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### 查询识别记录详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detections/{{recordId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### 读取自己的原始识别图片
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detections/{{recordId}}/image/original
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
